// Allocation-attribution fixture (attribution category, D-385/D-386): 1,000
// Stdlib-plugin native calls, no collection growth. Isolates per-native-call
// dispatch overhead on that path — the args array plus VmInvoker closure built
// on every native call in VirtualMachine.cs — from array/map growth cost.
//
// This measures the registered-once, GetGlobal-per-call plugin path only. The
// array/map instance-method path costs more per call (phase 1 §4); its
// growth-free control is attr-array-dispatch.grob, not this fixture.
for i in 1..1000 {
    "x".upper()
}
